      "settings": {
        "title": "Unleash Your RC Passion: Explore Yokomo at Hearns Hobbies",
        "html": "<div class=\"card__section expandable-content expandable-content--expandable\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"padding: 5px\">\n<div class=\"rte text--pull\">\n<p>Welcome to Hearns Hobbies, your ultimate destination for all things RC-related in Australia. Are you ready to dive into the exhilarating world of Yokomo RC cars? At Hearns Hobbies, we pride ourselves on offering an extensive selection of Yokomo products, each crafted with precision, performance, and innovation in mind.</p>\n<h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/yokomo-on-road-kits\">Yokomo RC Cars</a>: Precision Performance at Its Finest</h2>\n<p>Step into the realm of Yokomo RC cars, where every curve and contour is engineered for precision performance. Whether you're a seasoned racer or a beginner looking for excitement, Yokomo offers something for everyone. From agile drift cars to rugged off-road machines, Hearns Hobbies has a wide variety of Yokomo RC cars to suit your preferences. Feel the thrill of speed and control as you unleash the power of Yokomo on the track or off-road terrain.\n</p>\n<h2>Genuine <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/yokomo-spare-parts\">Yokomo Spare Parts</a>: Keeping Your Adventure Going Strong</h2>\n<p>At Hearns Hobbies, we understand the importance of keeping your RC adventure going strong. We offer a comprehensive range of genuine Yokomo spare parts and accessories. From suspension components to <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/servos?sort_by=manual&amp;filter.v.price.gte=&amp;filter.v.price.lte=&amp;filter.p.vendor=YOKOMO\">Yokomo radio &amp; servos</a> to everything in between, we have everything you need to keep your Yokomo RC car running smoothly. Trust Hearns Hobbies to provide quality and reliability, ensuring that your RC journey is always on track.</p>\n<h2>Drift to Style with <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/yokomo-kit?page=1\">Yokomo Kits</a> and Accessories</h2>\n<p>Experience the thrill of precision drifting with Yokomo drift kits and accessories. Designed for maximum control and style, <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/yokomo-drift-cars\">Yokomo drift cars</a> are a favourite among RC enthusiasts. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced drifter, Hearns Hobbies has everything you need to take your drifting skills to the next level. From chassis setups to specialised tyres, we have the tools to help you carve your path to Style.</p>\n<h2>Dominate the Track with Yokomo Racing Innovations</h2>\n<p>Get ready to dominate the track with Yokomo racing innovations. Engineered for speed, agility, and performance, Yokomo racing cars are built to push the boundaries of RC racing. Whether you're competing in a local tournament or just racing for fun, Hearns Hobbies has the latest Yokomo racing innovations to help you come out on top. From motors to ESCs and tuning parts, we have everything you need to unleash your full potential on the track.</p>\n<p>Ready to take your RC experience to the next level? Explore the exciting world of Yokomo at Hearns Hobbies today. With precision engineering, performance, and innovation, Yokomo offers an unparalleled RC experience. Whether you're a racer, drifter, or hobbyist, Hearns Hobbies has everything you need to fuel your passion for RC. Also, make sure to follow us on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/HearnsHobbies/\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/hearnshobbies\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hearnshobbies\">Twitter</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/hearnshobbies\">Twitch</a> for any latest updates on our products or content about Yokomo's hobby products! Let Yokomo ignite your RC passion like never before.</p>\n</div>\n<button class=\" expandable-content__toggle\" style=\"padding:5px\">                             <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-icon\"></span>                         <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-text\" data-view-more=\"View more\" data-view-less=\"View less\">View more</span>                    \n<p></p></button>\n</div>"
      }
    },
